        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/image001_9rghrWM.png?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Rockstar has revealed that pre-orders for <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-everything-we-know-so-far-9357\">Grand Theft Auto 6</a> will begin at midnight on 25th June whatever your local time, it sounds like, and that there will be multiple versions of the game offered. Related to that: physical editions of GTA 6 will apparently be available from 12th November, several days ahead of the game's 19th November release. We've also, finally, got <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-prices-confirmed\">a steer on GTA 6's price</a>.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-preorders-gta6-no-disc\">Read more</a></p>",
